{"track":"r","category":"함수형 도구","level":3,"title":"apply로 행·열 합","desc":"<p>행렬 <code>m</code>의 <b>행별 합</b>을 벡터로 돌려주는 <code>row_totals(m)</code>을 <code>apply()</code>로 만드세요.</p>","starter":"row_totals <- function(m) {\n  \n}\n","solution":"row_totals <- function(m) {\n  apply(m, 1, sum)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>apply(행렬, 1, 함수)</code> 는 행마다, <code>2</code>는 열마다 함수를 적용해요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"row_totals(matrix(1:6, nrow = 2))","expected":[9,12],"visible":true},{"call":"row_totals(matrix(c(1, 1, 1, 1), nrow = 2))","expected":[2,2],"visible":true},{"call":"row_totals(matrix(5, nrow = 1, ncol = 3))","expected":15,"visible":false},{"call":"row_totals(matrix(1:6, nrow = 3))","expected":[5,7,9],"visible":false}],"id":"r-525"}